{"title":"2022 SSMO Team Round Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_SSMO_Team_Round_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2><p>\nConsider the following rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/f/dafb324902af9772751731e815ab84e05f4efcb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC=8$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />. Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/6/4b67f8280b2f10bf75e16117010ba1e007a7b399.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[CD=CT_2,\\quad 4T_2P_2=2DP_1=AC,\\quad[ADP_1C]=33, \\quad\\text{and}\\quad[ABP_2C]=34.\\]\" width=\"601\" height=\"18\" /> Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/b/54b695d53cd6268d6f79728f8594fa3b9e81c9c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[P_1CP_2A]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\" />. </p><center> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/d/a3d1ccf25f5af9862c9520d6e99bb1e35a27fd61.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(6cm); dot((0,0)); dot((12,0)); dot((12,16)); dot((0,16)); draw((0,0)--(12,0)--(12,16)--(0,16)--(0,0)--cycle); dot((8,22)); dot((17,4)); dot((8,16)); dot((12,4)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, (0,0), SW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, (12,0), SE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, (12,16), NE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, (0,16), NW); label(&quot;$P_1$&quot;, (8,22), NE); label(&quot;$P_2$&quot;, (17,4), SE); label(&quot;$T_1$&quot;, (8,16), SE); label(&quot;$T_2$&quot;, (12,4), SW); draw((8,22)--(8,16),dashed+linewidth(.5)); draw((12,4)--(17,4),dashed+linewidth(.5)); [/asy]\" width=\"238\" height=\"285\" /> </center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_SSMO_Team_Round_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/0/0a0bbad507209d4947c10a4c8ab5274bff49d568.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"65\" height=\"14\" />. We have, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/b/7bb90750a4ae2ab5a0c946472f9a52d0169c3da0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[AC=\\sqrt{AB^2+BC^2}=\\sqrt{x^2+64}\\implies T_2P_2=\\frac{AC}{4}=\\frac{\\sqrt{x^2+64}}{4}.\\]\" width=\"507\" height=\"40\" /> Now,  \\begin{align*} [ABP_2C]&amp;=[ABC]+[BCP_2]\\\\ &amp;=\\frac{AB\\cdot BC}{2}+\\frac{BC\\cdot T_2P_2}{2}\\implies\\\\ 34&amp;=\\frac{8\\cdot x}{2}+\\frac{8\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{64+x^2}}{4}}{2}\\implies\\\\ 34&amp;=4x+\\sqrt{64+x^2}\\implies x=6. \\end{align*} Now,  \\begin{align*} [ADP_1C]&amp;=[ADC]+[DCP_1]\\\\ &amp;=\\frac{AD\\cdot DC}{2}+\\frac{DC\\cdot T_1P_1}{2}\\implies\\\\ 33&amp;=\\frac{6\\cdot8}{2}+\\frac{6\\cdot T_1P_1}{2}\\implies T_1P_1=3. \\end{align*} So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/4/bc47c0322296b0951c9ed1b71e8cb386b6464479.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[DT_1=\\sqrt{DP_1^2-T_1P_1^2}=\\sqrt{\\left(\\frac{10}{2}\\right)^2-3^2}=4\\]\" width=\"344\" height=\"53\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/9/299d700de9814f92fbe3ffd4dbd8d2cb2ab3d934.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[T_2B=CB-CT_2=CB-CD=8-6=2.\\]\" width=\"347\" height=\"15\" /> We have \\begin{align*} [P_1CP_2A]&amp;=[ADP_1C]+[ABP_2C]-[ADP_1]-[ABP_2]\\\\ &amp;=33+34-\\frac{AD\\cdot DT_1}{2}-\\frac{AB\\cdot T_2B}{2}\\\\ &amp;=33+34-\\frac{8\\cdot4}{2}-\\frac{6\\cdot2}{2}=\\boxed{45}. \\end{align*}\n</p><p>~pinkpig\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018022244\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 42/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2249/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26205:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018022244 and revision id 280165. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}